    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You summon sharp fragments of technological junk that fly toward your target and deal 3d6 piercing and slashing damage. The spell leaves behind 1 bulk of junked electronic equipment in the target creature’s space that is suitable for targeting with spells such as&nbsp;battle junkbot,&nbsp;handy junkbot,&nbsp;healing junkbot,&nbsp;junk armor,&nbsp;junk restraints, or&nbsp;junksword. The junked electronics have no resale value and cannot be repaired into any functioning item. A creature trained in Engineering or Physical Science can reveal the useless nature of the junk by directly examining it.</p>"
